  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### Practice Management - Scheduling\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 12 Oct, 2020 at  5:26 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Practice Management module > Workspace > Clients > Select Client > Schedule\n\nRefer to the link\n\nThe Schedule feature is used for sending Meeting invites to your clients directly from Capium, read through the guidance below to learn how to use Schedule.\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nNavigate to schedule and click 'New'\n\nthen enter the event details and either Save As Draft or Send.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188563\">Practice Management Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Practice Management - Scheduling\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 12 Oct, 2020 at  5:26 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Location:</strong> Practice Management module &gt; Workspace &gt; Clients &gt; Select Client &gt; Schedule</p><p><a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/client/Clientdetails/5cf4e8d34a7d4c6ee84e4eb3\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p><br></p><p>The Schedule feature is used for sending Meeting invites to your clients directly from Capium, read through the guidance below to learn how to use Schedule.</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Help/Guide:</strong></p><p>Navigate to schedule and click 'New'</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081329846/original/NNRLddnKpOH_v_SBmMVlurTH9TvwM9Q9Aw.png?1562602111\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081329846/original/NNRLddnKpOH_v_SBmMVlurTH9TvwM9Q9Aw.png?1562602111\" data-fileid=\"9081329846\" data-uniquekey=\"1562601709380\" style=\"width: 766px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>then enter the event details and either Save As Draft or Send.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081330093/original/_yT-XsBylVTr5kXVjGXHOsF-Ac5fiJzMKw.png?1562602247\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081330093/original/_yT-XsBylVTr5kXVjGXHOsF-Ac5fiJzMKw.png?1562602247\" data-fileid=\"9081330093\" data-uniquekey=\"1562601709380\" style=\"width: 765px;\"></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172247\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172247/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172247\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172247/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172247\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help u